# A site package page object of the other shape: PAGEVIEW instead of FLUIDTEMPLATE.
#
# It reads neither "templateName" nor "partialRootPaths" - it resolves the template as
# "Pages/<page layout without the pagets__ prefix>" below "paths", and derives its partial
# and layout root paths from the same "paths" by appending "Partials/" respectively
# "Layouts/" (PageViewContentObject::render()). An extension that registers a partial root
# path only under "partialRootPaths" is therefore invisible here, which is what this
# fixture is for.
#
# Included before the TypoScript of the extension, like the FLUIDTEMPLATE fixture next to
# it.
page = PAGE
page {
  10 = PAGEVIEW
  10 {
    paths {
      10 = EXT:academic_programs/Tests/Functional/Pages/Fixtures/PageViewTheme/
    }
  }
}
